Word lists in this folder come from two other projects.
They are downloaded and checked by scripts/import_word_lists.py, which pins
the exact commits below.

answers.inc
  Source:  https://github.com/stuartpb/wordles (file wordles.json)
  Commit:  6072f5b335dfa33b6abfb8ab18fbce2ba42f2b62
  License: the repository has no license file. Its README describes common
           English word lists as commonly considered public domain.

guesses.inc
  Source:  https://github.com/tabatkins/wordle-list (file words)
  Commit:  255b9469c4dad99a3b95cc4ddbe139b3d3747868
  License: MIT, reproduced below as that license requires.

